  "description": "The Thunderer was a Resurgent-class Star Destroyer that was used by the First Order. During the occupation of the Colossus, the Thunderer tried to stop the Colossus from jumping to hyperspace and leaving Castilon. After the supertanker fuel depot's escape, the Thunderer was used by Agent Tierny and Commander Pyre as they continued to pursue the Colossus, under orders from Captain Phasma to destroy it. The Thunderer got destroyed during a skirmish in the Barabesh system against the Colossus.",
